  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine - Programme coordination in situ</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of UNESCO&apos;s emergency assistance to Ukraine in the context of the on-going war, UNESCO will deploy a Coordination/Liaison Officer in Kyiv for a short-term mission of an initial duration of nine months to coordinate UNESCO&apos;s operations on the ground, in and for Ukraine across all sectors and engage in resource mobilization from donors supporting Ukraine. Key activities will include: coordination and interaction with national and UNCT counterparts, security, monitoring and reporting on the developments in Ukraine, development of UNESCO projects with partners and resource mobilization and identification of funding opportunities</narrative>
  </description>
